<title>FRANCE: UAP aims for 10 pct ROE before 2000.</title>
<headline>UAP aims for 10 pct ROE before 2000.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>UAP chairman Jacques Friedmann said on Wednesday that the company was aiming for a 10 percent return on equity before the end of the decade.</p>
<p>Return on equity is currently five percent.</p>
<p>The company hopes to obtain a ten percent return on equity &quot;before the end of the decade,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
<p>Union des Assurances reported earlier on Wednesday a 6.7 percent rise in first-half profit and said it was on track for a return to &quot;lasting profitability&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
